OL,3,GNEWSATeen slashed man in face with
OL,4,Aknife at house party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who burst into a house with three
OL,7,Faccomplices and slashed a man's face
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for four and a half
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FHarlie Johns, now aged 20, was jailed
OL,12,Ftwo years to the day after the violent
OL,13,Fattack at a house party in South
OL,14,FShields, Newcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,16,FThe victim said he had been scarred for
OL,17,Flife, while Recorder Nathan Moxon said
OL,18,Fthe attack stemmed from a "dangerous"
OL,19,Fand potentially fatal mix of "immature
OL,20,Fyoung men fuelled by alcohol and
OL,21,Fbravado" and a "truly terrifying"
OL,22,Fknife.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
