OL,3,GNEWSATeen slashed man in face with
OL,4,Aknife at house party
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohns, of Norham Avenue South in South
OL,7,FShields, admitted intentional wounding,
OL,8,Fpossessing a knife and violent
OL,9,Fdisorder. Three other young men were
OL,10,Fgiven suspended sentences for violent
OL,11,Fdisorder.
